# Everything is versioned. The only exception is a SECRET.
#
# Rationale (EOP ADR-086, adopted fleet-wide): a directory that holds an open
# question or a verdict is memory, not execution — keeping it out of git has
# already caused real loss. Diff noise (counters, timestamps) is a
# commit-granularity decision, not a reason to ignore a file.
#
# `.claude/` and `.continue/` are versioned ON PURPOSE. Do not add them here.
# Any new exception beyond secrets requires an ADR in docs/decisions.md, never
# a silent line in this file.

# Secrets and credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx

# Local agent overrides (may contain machine-specific paths and tokens)
.claude/settings.local.json

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
